# Flowchart basics: labels, shapes, edge labels, direction and Markdown.
# Try editing a label, then click Format. Click a shape to find its source.
# Reference: https://d2lang.com/tour/shapes/
...@zoomflow
direction: down
request: Support request {class: [zf-terminal; zf-filled]}
decision: Enough information? {class: [zf-decision; zf-filled]}
clarify: Ask for details {class: [zf-step; zf-filled]}
resolve: Resolve the issue {class: [zf-step; zf-filled]; style.border-radius: 12}
done: Customer notified {class: [zf-terminal; zf-filled]}
request -> decision
decision -> clarify: No {class: zf-no}
clarify -> decision: Updated request {style.stroke-dash: 4}
decision -> resolve: Yes {class: zf-yes}
resolve -> done
guide: |md
  **Try it**

  - Change the decision label
  - Switch direction to right
  - Export an SVG or PNG
|
